# Lockfiles. The committed lockfiles are uv.lock (backend) and
# frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml; CI installs from both with --locked/--frozen-lockfile
# so the dependency graph a gate runs against is the one under review. Only
# lockfiles for package managers this repo does not use are ignored.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
